    "title": "LPS Foundation breakfast Sept. 19",
    "text": "LPS Foundation breakfast Sept. 19\n- Courtesy Lawton Public Schools\n- Updated\nAs featured on\nLAWTON, OK — As Holly Phillips was recovering from a kitchen accident involving boiling water, she wondered if her students at Eisenhower Elementary School would know what to do in an emergency.\nThat incident prompted her to apply for a grant last year through the Lawton Public School Foundation to provide third through fifth graders with first aid kits. She applied for the grant, which is where Sovereign Title stepped in.",
